## PART C — Data contract (collections, fields, who reads/writes)

`Long` = epoch milliseconds. "A" = admin panel, "App" = Android app.

### C.1 `licenses/{KEY}` — document id = KEY uppercase, format `NUSRAT-AR-XXXX-XXXX`
| Field | Type | Written by | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `tier` | string `"pro"` \| `"master"` | A | Android: pro/master = Premium (lower-cased by app) |
| `userId` | string \| null | A (assign) / App (activation) | null → anyone may activate; else only that UID |
| `userEmail` | string \| null | A | info |
| `isUsed` | bool | App (activation) / A (reset) | |
| `revoked` | bool | A | true → activation denied, Premium removed |
| `durationDays` | number | A | used when `expiresAt == 0` |
| `expiresAt` | **Long**, `0` = not yet activated | App (first activation) / A (extend) | ⚠ must not be Timestamp |
| `maxDevices` | number | A | |
| `boundDevices` | array<string> | App / A | Device IDs |
| `createdAt`, `lastUsedAt` | **Long** | A / App | ⚠ not Timestamp |
| `createdBy` | string | A | admin UID |

### C.2 `users/{uid}`
App writes (only during activation, via `set(..., merge)`): `uid`, `tier`, `activeLicenseKey`, `licenseExpiresAt`(Long), `lastSeenAt`(Long). App **reads only** `status`.
Admin writes: `status` (`"active"` \| `"blocked"`), plus panel-only `plan`, `premium`, `premiumExpiry`, `licenseExpiresAt`.
**Nobody except admin may write `status`.** (Doc may not exist before first activation → admin "Users" lists only activated users; use "Devices" for all devices.)

### C.3 `devices/{deviceId}`
| Field | Written by | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `deviceId, manufacturer, model, brand, osVersion, sdkVersion, lastSeenAt` | App telemetry | |
| `status`: `pending`→`active`; admin may set `revoked`/`blocked` | App (activation) / A | Premium requires `active` + `tier` ≠ basic + not expired |
| `tier`, `isPremium`, `expiresAt`(Long), `licenseKey`, `userId` | App at activation (only when backed by a valid license); A | |
| `statusBeforeBlock` | A | admin unblock restores it |

### C.4 `system_config/maintenance` (public read, admin write)
`maintenanceEnabled`(bool) `maintenanceTitle` `maintenanceMessage` `startAt`(Long, 0=none) `endAt`(Long) `estimatedEndAt`(Long) `allowAdminBypass`(bool) `updatedAt`(Long)

### C.5 `system_config/app_update` (public read, admin write; written automatically by admin "Publish")
`versionCode`(Long) `versionName` `downloadUrl`(https) `fileSize`(Long) `checksumSha256`(hex, optional) `releaseNotes` `forceUpdate`(bool) `minSupportedVersionCode`(Long) `publishedAt`(Long) `isActive`(bool) `source`(`"storage"`|`"link"`)

### C.6 Admin-only collections (app never reads)
- `admins/{uid}`: `active`(bool) `email` `name` `role`(`super_admin`|`admin`) `invited`(bool) `addedBy` `createdAt` `setupDone`
- `app_updates/{id}` (release records): `source`(`storage`|`link`) `packageName` `versionName` `versionCode` `minSupportedVersion` `releaseNotes` `downloadUrl` `storagePath`(null for link) `fileSize` `sha256` `releaseDate` `createdBy` `published` `force` (+ transient `status:"deleting"|"delete_failed"`)
- `app_config/global`, `plans/{id}`, `notification_requests/{id}` (**queue only — not delivered**), `adminAuditLogs/{id}` (append-only: `adminUid adminEmail action targetUid targetDeviceId prev next ts`)

### C.7 Remote network control (app ↔ app)
`network_commands/{cmdId}`: `commandId targetDeviceId sourceDeviceId sourceUid action parameters executed resultMessage executedAt timestamp signature` · `device_network_status/{deviceId}`

